//api.github.com/users/kantuni/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kantuni/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2020-02-16T16:55:27Z","updated_at":"2020-10-28T06:45:26Z","closed_at":"2020-10-28T06:45:26Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"# Summary\r\n\r\nWhen a dataframe is loaded, sorted on a column at the end, and then the number of columns is reduced, a \"Bad sortColumnIdx\" error is thrown.\r\n\r\n# Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\nMinimal, Reproducible Example:\r\n```\r\nimport numpy as np\r\nimport pandas as pd\r\nimport streamlit as st\r\n\r\nn = st.sidebar.number_input('Number of columns', value=5)\r\ndf = pd.DataFrame(np.random.randint(0, 10, size=(10, n)))\r\nst.dataframe(df)\r\n```\r\n\r\n1. Run the app\r\n2. Sort the dataframe on the last column\r\n3. Reduce the number of columns\r\n\r\n## Expected behavior:\r\n\r\nThe dataframe should revert to unsorted or be sorted by its last column.\r\n\r\n## Actual behavior:\r\n\r\nThe dataframe is not displayed and a Bad sortColumnIdx error is shown.\r\n\r\n## Is this a regression?\r\n\r\nNo\r\n\r\n# Debug info\r\n\r\n- Streamlit version: 0.56.0\r\n- Python version: 3.8.1\r\n- Conda environment\r\n- OS version: macOS 10.14.6\r\n- Browser version: Firefox 72.0.1, Chrome 79.0.3945.130\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"kantuni","id":6151409,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNTE0MDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6151409?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kantuni","html_url":"https://github.com/kantuni","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kantuni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kantuni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github